ADDITIONAL NOTICE (NOT A LICENSE TERM, JUST A PRACTICAL WARNING):

This software is an automated trading Expert Advisor (EA) for MetaTrader 4.
By default it includes Nanpin (averaging-down) functionality with a 2.0x
Martingale ratio and up to 100 layers. Such configurations can result in
catastrophic losses, including loss of the entire account balance, under
adverse market conditions. This is a mathematical property of Martingale
strategies, not a defect of this software.

Past trading results, including backtest results, do not guarantee future
results. FX trading involves leverage and may result in losses exceeding
deposited funds. Use this software at your own risk, after thorough testing
in a demo account, and only with capital you can afford to lose entirely.

The author and contributors of this repository are not investment advisors
and do not provide investment advice. This software is a free, open-source
tool, distributed without affiliation to any broker or introducing-broker
(IB) program.
